  },
  "review": [
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "So delicious and easy to put together. It was a big hit!\r\nThe quick recipe for the tamarind chutney was very helpful since I hadn’t made it before. I also made a big batch of chaat masala since I couldn’t find it in the local shops, so I’ll have that on hand for next time!",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Eli"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-08-23"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "This chana chaat is amazing, so fast and delicious. I have been on a weight loss journey for sometime now. So I make this almost daily and love your idea of air fried potatoes. I can't eat potatoes so replace with sweet potatoes. Boil the chickpeas for a week and make the chutney too. I love how you give easy and healthy ideas like the cornflakes here. Thank you. Keep posting.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Vidya"
      },
      "datePublished": "2023-03-25"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Used canned chana &amp; whipped up coriander chutney in minutes. Chana chaat turned out very delicious.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Jenny"
      },
      "datePublished": "2023-03-05"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Just like all your other recipes, this was a huge hit! I only had desi chana on hand, so I used that instead of kabuli and it was still delicious!  I will be making this regularly. Thanks for sharing!",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Andrew"
      },
      "datePublished": "2021-11-09"
    }
  ],
